    "spec": "The locality derivation must now prefer the postcode: look up the region by postcode range first (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099), and only fall back to the city-to-region table when the postcode is absent or in no known range. This returns the same region for known cities but disambiguates cities that share a name.",
